(12919,276,'custom','Select the first product where Stock on S/O is 0 and Actual Yard Stock is greater than 5.',' Stock on S/O,Actual Yard Stock','# Click on PCS column header
page.locator(
    "//div[@role=\'columnheader\' and @data-field=\'StockOnSoPCS\']//div[text()=\'(PCS)\']"
).click()

# Click checkbox for first row where:
# actualYardStockPCS > 2
