(20804,384,'custom','Click checkbox in product id whose Actual Yard Stock greater than o and stock on S/O equals zero and add 4-5 different items from look up.','Click checkbox in first row where Actual Yard Stock > 0 and Stock on S/O = 0','# Click on PCS column header
